[{"title":"题三易备遗","author":"葛寅炎","text":"谁凿混沌窍，龙马出澄渊。\n笃生羲文圣，立极先后天。\n三三羑所演，两两山之连。\n不假人安排，自有天浑全。\n咸阳烈焰起，斯文独不烟。\n中更九师斸，惨于秦火然。\n言湮道随裂，尔来千馀年。\n皇乎钜宋兴，奎聚五珠联。\n天子图出地，复钟二钜贤。\n门外俨立雪，窝中闲弄丸。\n数加一倍法，书得七分传。\n文后不为后，羲先不为先。\n呜呼中天易，锁簧透黄轩。\n厥数则用六，是为归藏焉。\n观象历可纪，聆凤律相宣。\n芸芸茁九地，终至硕果坚。\n薛野鳦未乳，鼎湖龙已仙。\n敦哉司徒氏，而把五教权。\n滔滔祚其海，始达溜涓涓。\n韬光夏台出，拨乱南巢迁。\n执中亦建中，道体无些偏。\n义礼两夹持，以此裕我昆。\n姓别取诸子，世号遽以千。\n甲庚至丁乙，天潢衍庆源。\n不幸辛也虐，竟以甲子颠。\n牝晨艳方煽，太白旗已竿。\n衣宝炎炎里，道器俱无存。\n仁哉尔王子，独抱祭器奔。\n想偕此书抱，器完道亦完。\n有客皓其马，归作周之藩。\n俾食豫土毛，一发千钧绵。\n不然之宋叟，胡此得坤乾。\n我知苍苍者，寄道于不言。\n孔也商之人，宋也商之孙。\n茫茫宇宙阔，斯道萃一门。\n粤从两楹梦，寥寥绝韦编。\n浅者胶于卜，深者痼于玄。\n固哉房直日，诞矣雄入泉。\n八工亮图法，百贾庄肆钱。\n皮毛太初历，糟粕一行禅。\n天窗两呼吸，谁契希夷眠。\n极根一动静，谁悟溓翁圈。\n邵程又尘土，河洛空奫涟。\n翕固张之的，晦乃彰之根。\n节彼雁南荡，气复合真元。\n攒青华盖卓，湛碧芙蕖妍。\n石乳腻昏雨，玉红绚朝暾。\n孕此古心子，通身太极浑。\n香如梅月咽，朱浥花露研。\n吉凶扣灵蔡，消长听啼鹃。\n寂虑那三画，游神这一环。\n六十六十四，甲甲卦卦圆。\n仰接先天后，俯超后天前。\n中天此中兴，亚康节伊川。\n问君易何在，庭草翠无边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4476,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四并堂","author":"葛密","text":"华圃控弦秋习射，寒窗留烛夜钞书。\n良辰美景饶心事，观日相并乐起予。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4477,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"近造浮屠之悟空者睹君谟省主给事留题诗板列楣栋间粲然可诵因摭方袍之意成拙句以寄","author":"葛密","text":"昔年诗板著莲宫，笔力雄豪墨彩丰。\n不日三阶平国政，山僧应待碧纱笼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4478,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读道藏 其二","author":"葛密","text":"鍊成真气发双华，还向囊中秘玉霞。\n咒水夜潭龙怖剑，弄云秋岭鹤看家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4479,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读道藏 其一","author":"葛密","text":"仙茎屡陨三危露，真馆常开四照花。\n鹊渚晓烟飞玉洞，琅池秋水接星槎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4480,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬夜宿演教院","author":"葛密","text":"槭槭严风夕，烟含蕙炷清。\n灯生花里艳，雨作雪时声。\n旅梦回残角，吟怀绕废城。\n寂然群动息，吾亦世纷平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4481,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和李都官春日见寄","author":"葛密","text":"闻说年来绝世荣，更将高节傲时明。\n诗腴偏得味中味，琴的静弹声外声。\n宴榭日长花影驻，春池风细水纹生。\n相望空欲閒相见，彼此闲居懒送迎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4482,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿凝院呈山主志师","author":"葛密","text":"一径直岩隈，亭轩四面开。\n涛头转山急，雨脚满江来。\n怪石生云气，修篁待凤材。\n他年白莲社，应许继宗雷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4483,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"喜子书思登第","author":"葛密","text":"传家何用富金籯，教子何如只一经。\n庆历科名今已继，更教来叶嗣前馨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4484,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠蔡君谟赴漳南幕","author":"葛密","text":"藻思旧传青管梦，哲科新试碧鸡才。\n乍依仲宝莲花幕，更下温郎玉镜台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4485,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"葛密","text":"我悟惝来空世界，师知休去忘形骸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4486,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"葛密","text":"色空了了空还执，体相如如相即非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4487,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"葛密","text":"山禽啼晓四时别，林薮战秋千里空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4488,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虎丘呈元机上人","author":"葛逸","text":"楼观倚云端，烟收陆海宽。\n苍崖留剑迹，古木见龙蟠。\n石径青苔滑，霜林木叶乾。\n凭栏千里豁，爽气逼人寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4489,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题雪窦和尚亲书偈后","author":"葛繁","text":"真机昔振云门路，祖席今多雪窦孙。\n传到慧林花果盛，须知叶落总归根。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4490,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"董乂","text":"六月凉窗凉衽袖，二苏辞翰照青冥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4491,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"董乂","text":"缥渺烟中渔父桨，坡陀山上使君衙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4492,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题澹山岩","author":"董与几","text":"厥初谁剖混沌壳，光明仅透天一握。\n龙门凿断工有馀，劖划巉岩开洒落。\n我来沆砀千崖高，溜雨万丈声萧骚。\n岩上风烟岩下水，晚寻丹灶夜渔舠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4493,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"兴庆池禊宴","author":"董士廉","text":"岁和事简正韶春，兴庆池边乐众宾。\n寻胜此时追曲水，赏芳良会属平津。\n映花语笑秋千女，隔岸丝簧祓禊人。\n深愧薄才叨下幕，酒酣应许吐车茵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4494,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹","author":"董天吉","text":"移家徒得竹成林，老节清阴岁月深。\n近日孙枝殊圣长，风天雨夜学龙吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4495,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梧","author":"董天吉","text":"一树梧桐烂熳开，紫沉黄玉是花材。\n谁教著在朝阳地，勾引丹山老凤来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4496,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"主簿年家丈游敬亭","author":"董天吉","text":"逆旅频争席，郊原一振衣。\n联镳寻胜去，高盖拂林飞。\n访古江山是，怀人岁月非。\n禅林最安稳，栖鸟亦深依。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4497,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿千奴监司","author":"董天吉","text":"绿鬓貂蝉合殿中，輶车又过大江东。\n九重行侍君王宴，五度曾乘御史骢。\n好学襟怀开霁月，爱民心事蔼春风。\n夜深香火听舆诵，好是称觞寿母同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4498,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"采石矶","author":"董天吉","text":"断矶江上碧嶙峋，漠漠芦花转岸濒。\n舟小风微犹胜马，山高石立宛如人。\n羡渠钓艇沧波阔，老我征途白发新。\n寂寞蛾眉在天际，远烟青处晚双颦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4499,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送任浙东廉使 其一","author":"董天吉","text":"曾闻鼻祖牧宣州，又见邦人送我侯。\n世阅双旌相绚映，人生五马自风流。\n西偏清啸独孤观，北望高吟小谢楼。\n此去骅骝谙旧路，定知原隰望咨诹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4500,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送任浙东廉使 其二","author":"董天吉","text":"画戟凝香礼数殊，敢勤屣履下庸愚。\n有时小队寻花柳，也枉前茅到竹梧。\n对客每曾蒙齿录，问年直恐混泥涂。\n使君早晚朝天阙，还念沧江钓叟无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4501,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送经历庞世安","author":"董天吉","text":"鹿门培隐德，凤穴产奇毛。\n曳组全家贵，谈兵此客豪。\n书签沾雨湿，箭镝入云高。\n归到荆花下，春缸醉玉醪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4502,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"惠安桥","author":"董天吉","text":"涔阳山水壮南州，千尺飞梁速去邮。\n蛟鳄翻涛声吼夜，虹蜺分雨气横秋。\n险疑云栈通车马，高比银河挟女牛。\n钜万功成书太史，绝胜舟楫济中流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4503,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"永庆寺松风亭","author":"董天吉","text":"长松荫禅宇，柯叶何橚椮。\n清风一披拂，奏作绿绮琴。\n虬龙舞空祠，鸾凤相与吟。\n众籁起幽听，太虚本沉沉。\n翛然亭中人，宴坐欢妙音。\n心闻得深悟，明月生东林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4504,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"柏山僧房赏花","author":"董天吉","text":"云房閟孤赏，幽花杳谁攀。\n春风不掩私，吹芬满禅关。\n欣抃破沉寂，觅此芳菲颜。\n亭亭紫锦盖，济济玉笋斑。\n风流冠群英，擢自蓬擢间。\n感物动嘉咏，飞觞且循环。\n上人灭华念，对之心自闲。\n一笑吾未领，夕烟沉远山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4505,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"项王庙","author":"董天吉","text":"嬴氏乱天纪，群雄各飞扬。\n子羽勇无敌，拔剑起戎行。\n熊罴八千士，飙举度长江。\n威名震列国，斩婴爇咸阳。\n神力摧万夫，虎视邈四方。\n雄图竟不就，楚歌有馀伤。\n故国父老怜，遗庙苍山傍。\n莓苔生丹垩，萝蔓延门堂。\n灵魂岂不怍，宁肯还故乡。\n空令千载下，吊古增慨慷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4506,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月中桂","author":"董天吉","text":"云外仙花众莫俦，广寒宫殿足清幽。\n根盘天上一轮古，香落人间八月秋。\n玉兔杵频金粟碎，素娥佩湿露枝稠。\n史君方运吴刚斧，要放清光照此舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4507,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"童传","text":"古来风义遗才少，近世公卿荐士稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4508,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花三咏 其三 影","author":"董师谦","text":"疏花淡淡月娟娟，静坐参渠花月禅。\n翠羽飞来栖未稳，几回搅碎又依然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4509,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花三咏 其二 色","author":"董师谦","text":"京洛尘中耿素衣，苍头冷面古须眉。\n春风红紫百千变，惟有此花如旧时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4510,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅花三咏 其一 香","author":"董师谦","text":"雪蘤霜须苔藓枝，玉堂事去且疏篱。\n世人孔鼻无分别，吐露芳心欲向谁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4511,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钱塘怀古 其三","author":"董师谦","text":"衣带一条水，靴尖三百州。\n市朝陈迹在，图籍别人收。\n南渡衣冠尽，西湖歌舞休。\n久知事当尔，曾记五更头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4512,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钱塘怀古 其二","author":"董师谦","text":"玉床摇帝座，青盖出都城。\n巷哭千家泪，燕歌四面声。\n乾坤遽如许，风雪可怜生。\n清晓宫门外，犹听打六更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4513,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钱塘怀古 其一","author":"董师谦","text":"历历庚申事，分明在眼前。\n讲和如有弊，飞渡定无船。\n北使三千里，真州十四年。\n酿成亡国恨，一部福华编。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4514,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钱塘怀古 其四","author":"董师谦","text":"行人指新寺，云此旧宫城。\n坐殿几朝帝，开山何处僧。\n日边行塔影，天外送钟声。\n王气元无了，何消凿秣陵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4515,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"保应庙","author":"董朴","text":"庙食空山八百年，衣冠犹是李唐前。\n汴河十里垂杨柳，何似松阴数亩田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4516,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"灵仙观和危骊塘韵","author":"董居谊","text":"多病侵寻鬓欲秋，自惭何止四宜休。\n青松十里嵩源路，醉倒仙台是乐丘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4517,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"青云亭","author":"董居谊","text":"溪傍好山添翠湿，亭依乔木得阴浓。\n有人欲踏青云路，认取城南第一峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4518,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"群玉山 其五","author":"董居谊","text":"经台石磴郁深幽，曲折中藏自一邱。\n凿破藩篱都是路，从今任是永人游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4519,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"群玉山 其三","author":"董居谊","text":"浮世嚣尘不可干，漫山琮璧照人寒。\n客来莫认为顽石，具眼还须作玉看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4520,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"群玉山 其四","author":"董居谊","text":"顷年尝入道山来，天上图书不受埃。\n今日有怀群玉府，又从人世得蓬莱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4521,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"群玉山 其二","author":"董居谊","text":"石刻嘉名岁月多，苔封藓蠹欲消磨。\n天成有景无人问，不著新亭奈尔何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4522,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"群玉山 其一","author":"董居谊","text":"羁寓零陵过一年，每怜两脚负山川。\n忽从榛莽窥神秘，似与仙家有宿缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4523,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"见山楼下植梅百本九月见花","author":"董居谊","text":"手种寒梅度一春，主人指日是行人。\n孤根奈久不忘旧，疏蕊逢秋已献新。\n堪笑世情何恁薄，不知花意却相亲。\n年年记取栽培力，为送幽香入梦频。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4524,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戚姑山","author":"董居谊","text":"重上危楼意豁然，倚栏检点旧山川。\n身离城郭尘嚣里，眼到云天杳霭边。\n只恐老松添岁月，长教修竹障风烟。\n回思灯火书窗下，偻指如今六十年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4525,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"甘陂寺","author":"董昙","text":"晓发山间寺，篮舆冒朔风。\n雪融溪涨碧，云漏日穿红。\n岁月尘埃里，江山醉梦中。\n人生要家处，浪出笑庞公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4526,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失调名","author":"董武子","text":"畴昔寻芳秘殿西。\n日压金铺，宫柳垂垂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4527,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐山","author":"董俨","text":"千里远木笼秋浦，万里澄江浸落晖。\n醉恨春深输杜牧，满头无菊戴将归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4528,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"董俨","text":"白云深处访禅扉，一簇楼台锁翠微。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4529,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题怪石","author":"董将","text":"兹山翠成堆，峭骨乃如许。\n化工妙融结，石罅走青乳。\n当年女娲氏，炼此不及补。\n岩岩至于今，丈室枕其股。\n我来手摩挲，松阴日亭午。\n初疑道士羊，亦类将军虎。\n坐久饥肠鸣，试作先主煮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4530,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"棋山院","author":"董渊","text":"风际有云多世态，海中无底是人心。\n可堪更问棋山话，一局闲争古到今。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4531,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太常山","author":"董渊","text":"势凌筹谷接苍苍，十二交龙绣作裳。\n虎豹关中千树色，凤凰池上万花香。\n白云路隔青云暮，金涧泉通玉涧凉。\n圣代君臣忻际会，安知磐石镇无疆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4532,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"灵峰院龙龛山和蔡君谟","author":"董渊","text":"礧硌弥沙界，谽谺古洞天。\n门邻金布地，桥枕玉鸣泉。\n庭鹤归迷主，龛龙去失年。\n扫云嫌俗驾，题壁诧诗仙。\n胜景无今古，居人有后先。\n不知游者驭，谁见海为田。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4533,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑞峰院","author":"董渊","text":"石屏树幄白云端，溪路生苔树石间。\n闲访禅家问尘世，总言尘事不相干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4534,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄内","author":"董萝","text":"别向春闺十载深，家园无梦可追寻。\n酸风冷月凄官阁，瘴雨蛮烟度郁林。\n养老需卿扶健杖，怕寒怜我守孤衾。\n封侯未卜常滋愧，一寸程途一寸心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4535,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜泊浯溪 其一","author":"董鸿道","text":"舣舟和月上?亭，风露凄寒酒易醒。\n谁为漫郎写幽思，度香桥下水泠泠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4536,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜泊浯溪 其二","author":"董鸿道","text":"二十年前八桂回，摩挲苍藓读碑来。\n如今再自浯溪过，折得梅花伴酒杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4537,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"严子陵钓台和友人韵","author":"董循","text":"子陵垂钓逐江流，相与登台作共游。\n红叶黄花三峡雨，高风亮节一天秋。\n四围黛色迷青眼，满幅烟云锁绿洲。\n谁到严滩同玩赏，往来七里听渔讴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4538,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"董敦逸","text":"郁江清彻底，十里郡城南。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4539,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吊于湖墓在秣陵","author":"沈端节","text":"晓出白门下，疲马踏秋色。\n钟山度苍翠，慰我远游客。\n暮投清泉寺，花草献幽寂。\n长廊静无人，落日照西壁。\n平生张于湖，万里去一息。\n翻然九州外，汗漫跨鲸脊。\n乾坤能几时，安用较颜蹠。\n文章失津梁，所念斯道厄。\n夜阑耿不寐，搔首赋萧索。\n怀人感西风，翁仲守孤陌。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4540,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月十五日有感","author":"董嗣杲","text":"浔阳江上看明月，月落孤眠百感生。\n十二年前如昨日，竹斋曾醉凤箫声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4541,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"下彭泽","author":"董嗣杲","text":"江气瀰漫接楚浮，潘郎双鬓不禁秋。\n欲浇靖节荒祠酒，附得沙头贾客舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4542,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元宵怀乡二首 其二","author":"董嗣杲","text":"难觅围香醉玉仙，短灯油冻梗孤眠。\n清河坊里灯宵月，负却东风已两年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4543,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元宵怀乡二首 其一","author":"董嗣杲","text":"万宇灯辉敛暗尘，几年醉赏禁街春。\n良宵独宿双泉寺，负了吟风啸月身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":4544,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]